      "side": 1,
      "message": "`mix` is listed in the ES 3.10 spec as accepting bools, and I think we\u0027re 3.10 yea?\n\n```\ngenFType mix (genFType x, genFType y, genBType a)\ngenIType mix (genIType x, genIType y, genBType a)\ngenUType mix (genUType x, genUType y, genBType a)\ngenBType mix (genBType x, genBType y, genBType a)\n```\n\nhttps://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/specs/es/3.1/GLSL_ES_Specification_3.10.pdf\n\nIn HLSL a ternary evaluates both sides regardless of the condition, so does the semantics we expected from `select`.",
